{"type":"json_object","message":"The reconciliation table shows the balance of unrecognized tax benefits was $214.4 million at December 27, 2008 and $126.6 million at December 29, 2007. Net change = 214.4 − 126.6 = 87.8 ($ millions).","final":{"answer":"The net change in the balance of unrecognized tax benefits from the end of fiscal 2007 (December 29, 2007) to the end of fiscal 2008 (December 27, 2008) was an increase of $87.8 million.","value":87.8,"unit":"USD_million","sources":["source:t8c1n0","source:t8c2n0"],"result_id":"tool:1"}}